{"title":"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8cd2459277769586b44326e418ae9bc6b31bba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac492df145e91241495dc53c07281f55947a8bd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$||x|-x|-|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/52969fdeeb90f7e24cd2a2f1a6cfe124776fee2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/83602f0919b31021a0078aea1ec49824c56c0c08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2016\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2016\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4032\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6048$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"479\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By: dragonfly\n</p><p>First of all, lets plug in all of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />'s into the equation.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/376249fc757fae9fd68168e1e5a35496966d3657.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$||-2016|-(-2016)|-|-2016|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"254\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa20bd5589a24b36f31908c79ef9158cb0a2e67c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(-2016)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Then we simplify to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/7/9475ab1d95afd261a1471ac3b6f0fb8a0c1ee198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2016+2016|-2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3efebb3a916829cb8dfcbc91d74d9c67b98946a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>which simplifies into\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b781fdf1cd172b567be38e2ffa6f20f0b8390c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3efebb3a916829cb8dfcbc91d74d9c67b98946a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>and finally we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c311c950addb6e1b0ff620611b295e3d10d3b1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4032}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"83\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is negative.\n</p><p>We replace all instances of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/49428192d366caf373c0af3c3261687f12b4c883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/c/b0c76b0b83dcce1c23e4e2d58f8e9cfa6968f80b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$||x|+|x||-|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/1/f81a7c040f9625345f3b91177476d2e8f350065d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/b/60b3823935ee407b6ea7276146829a4e66045d79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2x|-|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/8909fac5d2ee5a846a221b5cd734f38f0855b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigg|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"3\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/1/f81a7c040f9625345f3b91177476d2e8f350065d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/49428192d366caf373c0af3c3261687f12b4c883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/1/f81a7c040f9625345f3b91177476d2e8f350065d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+|x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/9/fb949529dc15df9994d769cfaf12400f00313acd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=|2x|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c2fe7b86ebe76b307732e1279be565e67ca0b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4032 \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"146\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>omerselim1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" t